{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "35562f702cddd1fd86a1c43338c38560c39c4dbe31bd345634a8f4fd6140778e", "ja": "ゴーイン・トゥー・テイク", "zh": "要带去的地方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4b957f72a9211995e0bf6f89cb511c7435ce583bc7fec6e0021a2ece505dc667", "ja": "プロデューサーがレッスンに一度も顔を出さ\nない事にやきもきするジュリア。仕事の邪魔\nをしたくはないが、居ても立ってもいられず\n恵美と一緒に事務室へ乗り込む。ふたりは、\n戸惑うプロデューサーを強引に連れ出す。", "zh": "因制作人一次都没来上课而焦躁不安的茱莉亚。虽然不想妨碍工作，却坐立难安，于是和惠美一起闯进办公室。两人强行把困惑不已的制作人带了出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1000_050jul", "source_sha256": "9ad04b3e7ce6530ed8467feebbaacc126f23c44f4eebb615c8952a1dbffe0761", "ja": "……。\nだーっ！！！！", "zh": "……。\n啊——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "b46e5b8d02131bec60e93cf724bd59d71a18d1ccbdb38d44aa346f0c7d8b7659", "ja": "わ、ビックリした！\nなになに、どったの？　急に気合い入っちゃった？", "zh": "哇，吓我一跳！\n怎么啦怎么啦，出什么事了？突然就干劲十足起来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "55ad6e0683b27a435a4530306f06d5bb56d6336517fee6576dddffa5fe7c4c7b", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて……あのバカPのことだよ！\nあいつ、まだ一回も、レッスン見に来てないんだぜ？", "zh": "不，不是那样的……我是说那个笨蛋P啦！\n那家伙，可是一次都还没来看过练习呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "5519c3da86ec776d9551f54d48f4c096cbeeaea0d1fbac53294f4a4c35f3cc53", "ja": "あー、はいはい、それね。", "zh": "啊～好啦好啦，是那件事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "e614b929597f190e8a223b58ba3c8433c3b75f687181c25a290393da8ba4283d", "ja": "いくらなんでも、ほっときすぎだっての！\nったく……ウチらのこと、忘れてんじゃないだろうな。", "zh": "再怎么说，也放着我们不管太久了吧！\n真是的……该不会把我们给忘了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "bd5cf7be89e52e7f9c2b21006ba7af450a7a88f04c906dda75b31ceeb0aa77d5", "ja": "まあ、まだ時間あるしね～。\n曲ができたら、さすがに顔出すんじゃない？", "zh": "哎呀，反正还有时间嘛～。\n等曲子做好了，总该会露个面的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "6f869e3701d13965affacd93de341df2406756acf705ad16c76c0a4415c4fbed", "ja": "むぅ……。\nなんだよ恵美、聞き分けいいじゃん。", "zh": "唔……\n什么嘛，惠美，你还挺通情达理的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "65fdeac13c01d11dff4f98a3018c258ef2a4d3be162542bb1750506983035045", "ja": "いやいや、そこはしょうがないっしょ？\n仕事してるんだしさ。", "zh": "没有啦，那种事也是没办法的吧？\n毕竟是在工作嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "8a9cf2a4384714aa6d37e7ee21d352f9fd750f90b69fd3962ddbf35f741bc9d5", "ja": "今、マジでやばそうだしね～。\nさっき見かけたけど、ゾンビみたいになってたよ。", "zh": "现在看起来真的糟透了呢～  \n刚才看到他的时候，简直像个僵尸一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "d26f442103809c6ad11291b1741e5f3ed0415dd28b3f8381b88cec9c3900afbc", "ja": "そりゃ、わかってる。\nわかってるけど……あー、なんかムカつく！", "zh": "那当然知道。\n知道是知道……啊——真让人火大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "2a64cb7174e9e6e4bcc218865e459ac988fd6ab83fa4416f4db0eb35778f4834", "ja": "気持ちはわかるよ～。\nジュリアは怒ってるんじゃなくて、心配なんでしょ？", "zh": "我明白你的心情啦～  \n茱莉亚不是在生气，而是在担心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "ec1756fc614960f9f9ac310b2b5ce1ef8f3f9a3eb856167cefacda747e28067c", "ja": "い、いや、別にあたしはっ……！\n……って、恵美に言い訳したってムダだな。はは。", "zh": "没、没有，我才没有……！\n……唉，跟惠美找借口也是白费劲啊。哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "b95e45cd31d18a3e852956eebf8a4c8262da23097f874f42055e6a33b8bcd717", "ja": "そそ♪　言ったじゃん、アタシも同じ気持ちだから。", "zh": "对对♪我不是说过嘛，因为我也是一样的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "c98407632639f76299eedccdcf0313dd49babf25425855f2b05074d1ea643c9a", "ja": "そろそろ休めよ！　って、\n言ってやった方がいい気がするんだけど……。", "zh": "我觉得差不多该对他说“你也该休息了！”才对……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "34bd20cfeb60237da1524e35767113dd5b65daabc90945deb1b3774698557732", "ja": "だよね～。アタシも話しに行こうかと思ったんだ。\nけど、仕事の邪魔になりそうだな～って。", "zh": "就是嘛～我也正想着要不要过去跟他说说。\n不过又觉得好像会打扰他工作～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "43b86249bd54f30d2a6d17df925a0f45b68bc08d2fed9b0c201e33d392f27993", "ja": "それなんだよな……。\nウチらには、プロデュースの仕事はわかんないしさ。", "zh": "就是这个问题啊……\n我们也不懂制作人的工作嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "9bc5230fac8e69217b031f604fd37e650a3416f804b9815ac5413406b2333f54", "ja": "うーん……？", "zh": "嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "9bc5230fac8e69217b031f604fd37e650a3416f804b9815ac5413406b2333f54", "ja": "うーん……？", "zh": "嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "bf845513c62beee452eaab9b13e1a9aad5aabc60c71290e29c06eac19b14bc73", "ja": "……いや！　ウジウジ考えててもしょーがねえ。\nやりたいようにやるぜ、あたしは！", "zh": "……不对！瞻前顾后的也没用。\n我就要按自己的想法来干！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "3d6c275ac57c6867f15377fdbcc15f537fe87a178cf7939e55ad5625f4b8e57d", "ja": "えっ、ジュリア？　どゆこと？", "zh": "诶，茱莉亚？　什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "14ea561535b529bdf8568c5056a092458abab5a7014327ee30c8fb04d8301e76", "ja": "恵美、言ってくれたよな？　相手に合わせない、\nブレないところが、あたしのいいところだって。", "zh": "惠美，你之前对我说过吧？不迎合别人、\n毫不动摇就是我的优点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "6fe2f5d79e5f0045693be8ace8bc31593bf93cfa5c8259d846adc076f98a5823", "ja": "それに、恵美も話した方がいいって思ったんだろ？\nふたりがそう思ったなら、それが正解だよ、きっと。", "zh": "而且，恵美也觉得我还是说出来比较好吧？  \n既然我们两个人都这么想，那肯定就是正确答案了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "10eb7bb89685c4f08cc011255800f81c27a98e6bdd1f2ed48a24726591d00c38", "ja": "ん～……なんかよくわかんないけど、\n面白そうだし、ノッた♪　んで、なにしちゃうの？", "zh": "嗯～……虽然总觉得有点搞不明白，\n但听起来挺有意思的，我就答应啦♪ 所以，要做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "e5c2257cb1264dea9382ccfcf48be4a92af43512431b3415d441a05d3586582e", "ja": "へへっ、それは～……！", "zh": "嘿嘿，那就是～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "2eb76ac375ec392de7b126645a9901adfe11fc62f9a9ebe69ca23f4d60afc679", "ja": "（ええと……提出する書類はこれでOK、と。\n後は外回りと、打ち合わせと……ふぅ）", "zh": "（那个……要提交的文件这样就没问题了。接下来还有外勤和会议……呼。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "8675e993a814cf73d056fa938e102519542760bf655010bbd77376e38fb6c9c0", "ja": "（うーん、仕事がひっきりなしだな。\nジュリアと恵美には、悪いことを……）", "zh": "（嗯——工作真是一件接着一件啊。对茱莉亚和惠美，真是过意不去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "92d8325a0a7c3487739809da0a30a88c8436953aedf8abd1359951ba50911c1c", "ja": "おーいっ、{$P$}！", "zh": "喂～，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "92d8325a0a7c3487739809da0a30a88c8436953aedf8abd1359951ba50911c1c", "ja": "おーいっ、{$P$}！", "zh": "喂～，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1029_se", "source_sha256": "3dc399f3ece866d8dc827bd4e1faa17379d122a5630d6a6841bcfd6ec315725a", "ja": "バーンッ！", "zh": "砰——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "06c03007cfb2c6c13e5900365b714e526fc5569e6681c9b230a2a0bf93319a6b", "ja": "うわっ！？　えっ……ジュリア？　恵美も。\nどうしたんだ？　ふたりとも。", "zh": "哇！？呃……茱莉亚？还有惠美。\n怎么了？你们两个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "8df8d4f5e0a03124dd3af5e3f98b0cdcf82f43c67996dfea6ff5edb27442534a", "ja": "ふふん、覚悟しろ！　ウチらは今、人さらいなんだ。\n泣いても帰してやらないぜ♪", "zh": "哼哼，做好觉悟吧！我们现在可是绑架犯。就算你哭了也不会放你回去哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "63aad0d737eb4ca21cacdb6bd164122a277db90fb2533033a31c93df60982b16", "ja": "ほらほら、さらわれる支度して！\n言っとくけど、拒否権ないからね～？　にゃはは♪", "zh": "快快，做好被绑走的准备！\n先说好，你可没有拒绝的权利哦～？　呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "c3f63881e0fc884ae0b38d6286473fcbc76d28fda1402da730b28b4d3e34adf1", "ja": "そうそう！　ウチらのこと、ほっといたバツだ。\nっつーわけで……ちょっとツラかしな。", "zh": "对对！这就是把我们晾在一边的惩罚。也就是说……把脸凑过来一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "71592ac78480c9677a0530388cbf7fb2e138c272f79a77b2e798896406a6fc8f", "ja": "えっ……ええ……？", "zh": "诶……欸……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
